              }
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Read only: authorize the occurrence first, then resolve its saved Caller and Ref through the shared execution service. No query parameters are accepted. HTTP 200 is not execution success: require result.status=completed AND result.answerComplete=true. Null result means still running; a missing terminal result is an error."
      }
